## Elaborate desired get-egg-in-fridge-class -> sets desireds, desired, desired-count ....
## Get the egg in the fridge
## Uses world-context to defind class of egg, fridge, and that egg is in fridge
sp {elaborate*thor-soar*desired*get-egg-in-fridge-class
    :default
   (state <s> ^name thor-soar
              ^superstate nil
              ^flags.desired-selection get-egg-in-fridge-class)
-->
   (<s> ^desireds <desireds>)
   (<desireds> ^desired.holding-object.object-handle |unanchored-object-egg-handle|
               ^desired-count 1
               ^world-context <world>)
   (<world> ^objects.object <object-egg> <object-fridge>
            ^in <in>)
   (<object-egg> ^class egg
                 ^object-handle |unanchored-object-egg-handle|
                 ^anchored false)
   (<in> ^argument1 <object-egg>
         ^argument2 <object-fridge>)
   (<object-fridge> ^class fridge
                    ^object-handle |unanchored-object-fridge|
                    ^anchored false)
}

## Elaborate desired get-egg-in-fridge-class door-closed -> sets desireds, desired, avoid-desired ....
## Get the egg in the fridge
## Uses world-context to defind class of egg, fridge, and that egg is in fridge
