## Elaborate desired cook-potato55-microwave -> sets desireds, desired, desired-count ....
## Cook the potato in the microwave
## Explicity states must be cooked by microwave
sp {elaborate*thor-soar*desired*cook-potato55-microwave
    :default
   (state <s> ^name thor-soar
              ^superstate nil
              ^flags.desired-selection cook-potato55-microwave)
-->
